cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fidelis: local-first, zero-LLM memory for Claude Code and AI agents"
abstract: "Fidelis stores agent-curated records locally and retrieves their original text with stable IDs, correction history, and validity dates. Default MCP recall uses local vector search without a generative LLM. The PyPI distribution is fidelis-memory; the import name and CLI remain fidelis."
type: software
authors:
